### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api
@authToken = your_auth_token_here
@tenantId = 1

### 1. List All Active Packages
GET {{baseUrl}}/packages
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}
Accept: application/json

### 2. List Packages by Specific Instructor
GET {{baseUrl}}/packages?instructor_id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}
Accept: application/json

### 3. Create a New Package
POST {{baseUrl}}/packages
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "name": "Pacote Básico 10 Aulas",
    "description": "10 aulas práticas de direção veicular de 50 minutos cada",
    "hours": 10.00,
    "price": 850.00,
    "currency_code": "BRL",
    "active": true
}

### 4. Show Single Package
GET {{baseUrl}}/packages/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}
Accept: application/json

### 5. Update Package
PUT {{baseUrl}}/packages/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "name": "Pacote Básico 10 Aulas - Especial",
    "price": 800.00
}

### 6. Delete Package (Soft Delete)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/packages/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}
Accept: application/json
